+  /* A cold origin needs a little more continuation than simply releasing both
+     variables at an axis optimum.  Cross-fit the other coordinate while the
+     first one stays fixed, then let the coupled simplex polish that staged
+     point.  Try both orders because sigma and defocus have different transfer
+     shapes even when they produce similar carrier attenuation.  */
